SELECT DISTINCT ?item (CONCAT("{","{rfd links2\u007C",strafter(str(?item), "entity/"),"\u007Cfrom [[Wikidata:Database reports/to delete/completely empty items]]}","}") as ?del)
WHERE {
  ?item wikibase:statements 0; wikibase:sitelinks 0 .
  MINUS { ?item rdfs:label [] } .
  MINUS {
    ?item ?claim [] .
    [] wikibase:directClaim ?claim .
  } .
  MINUS { [] ?claim2 ?item } . # this also removes items with sitelinks (schema:about) from the results and thus helps with https://phabricator.wikimedia.org/T145712
  FILTER( ?item NOT IN (wd:Q16943273, wd:Q17566023) ) # comma separated list; Q16943273=sandbox item, Q17566023=Wikidata tours
}
ORDER BY ?item
